	"description": "This course presents computer programs design and implementation using the <a href=\"/search/?p=ANSI%20C\" data-action=\"result-detail\" data-group=\"code:ANSI C\" class=\"notoffered\" title=\"This course is not currently being offered\">ANSI C</a> language and C++. It will cover topics pertaining to program life-cycles, modularity, operators, expressions, flow control, functions, scope, recursion and iteration, pointers, memory allocation and management, structures and data files access. It includes an introduction to Object-Oriented design principles, designing and instantiating classes and developing class methods. It covers functions, arrays, I/O file streams and data files. It includes laboratory exercises on the writing and compiling of computer programs in C, C++.",
